OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining rain in the east along the
OL,7,Feast coast soon clearing as drier
OL,8,Fconditions with some clear spells
OL,9,Fspreads across from the west. Then
OL,10,Fmainly dry for the rest of the night
OL,11,Fbut showery rain will spread east
OL,12,Flater.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FCloudy start with some showery
OL,15,Frain. Then becoming brighter and
OL,16,Fmainly dry with the odd shower in the
OL,17,Fnorth and west.
